<title>UK: Volkswagen unit sets 100 mln rand one-year bond.</title>
<headline>Volkswagen unit sets 100 mln rand one-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Chase.</p>
<p> BORROWER   VOLKSWAGEN FINANCE NV</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  VOLKSWAGEN AG</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN RAND  COUPON     16.0	MATURITY    06.MAR.98</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.75    PAY DATE    06.MAR.97</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  A1/A+     DENOMS (K) 5-50	GOV LAW     GERMAN</p>
